scope: |
  The rest of the class rozum named on their slice: `Value.get`, `Value.exists`, and a
  `Value: From<Option<Value>>` bound. Same family as indexOf/find/zipWithIndex -- a method with no
  lowering, or a conversion with no impl. Not waiting for their next paste: the three names are
  enough to build the probes here.
  Each one is checked DIFFERENTIALLY against bin/ssc, because the pair-order bug in zipWithIndex
  showed that "it compiles" is not the same as "it means the same thing".
